<title>THAILAND: Somprasong Land Plc shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Somprasong Land Plc shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand halted trading in shares of the troubled Somprasong Land Plc in the mid-afternoon pending a disclosure from the company.  </p>
<p>The company's share price has been hit in recent months by trader concerns surrounding the firm's liquidity position.</p>
<p>Somprasong was down 0.8 baht, or 9.52 percent, at 7.60 baht since opening this morning. The year high was 66.50 baht.</p>
<p>The Thai property market has been hit by high intrest rates and oversupply this year.</p>
</text>
